id=nemu_boot_autostart
name=Nemu Boot Guard
version=1.8
versionCode=9
author=Nemu
description=Auto-unbrick guard (3 failed boots): verified clean shutdowns reset the counter; bounded suspend/component recovery with verification; only Nemu-owned disable-user packages and components are restored. v1.8 adds the shutdown ACK used by the LSPosed hook, initrc/FIFO restore hooks, and custom-target support.
